{
  "slug": "reco",
  "name": "Reco",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Reco SaaS & AI security — query app risks, shadow IT, AI agents, user posture, and access events directly from Claude Code",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent**, **5 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `reco-setup` (First-time initialization of the Reco MCP server `plugin:reco:mcp`)\n- **Agents** (1): `security-analyst` (Senior SaaS security analyst with full access to the Reco platform)\n- **Commands** (5): `check-shadow-it` (Find unsanctioned and unreviewed (shadow IT) applications in the environment), `investigate-app` (Deep-dive security investigation for a specific SaaS application), `list-risks` (Surface current HIGH and CRITICAL security risks across the environment), `reco-config`, `reco-setup`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `reco`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install reco@claude-community` from `RecoLabs/reco-mcp-plugins` (`claude`).",
